<title>USA: Noel stake held by Fir Tree group.</title>
<headline>Noel stake held by Fir Tree group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Fir Tree Partners and Jeffery Tannenbaum said Thursday it holds a 7.72 percent stake in Noel Group Inc or 1,576,700 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions were purchased between March 18 and May 5 at prices ranging from $3.3125 to $6.6250 per share.</p>
<p>Noel, based in New York, conducts its principal operations through small and medium sized operating companies.</p>
</text>
